	(text "S_amux(a,b,c,d)=(M0,M1,M2,M3)\n4-bit select returns 4 analog signals\nDisable by sending S < 3\n(a-e)(0-9)	reader phototransistors\nbA&dA		extra phototransistors\nM+&M-		motor phases\nVs&Is		source voltage&current\nVh=Vs/2\nLC			Lid Closed Signal\n\nS|M0|M1|M2|M3\n0 |a0|b0|c0|d0\n1 |a1|b1|c1|d1\n2 |a2|b2|c2|d2\n3 |a3|b3|c3|d3\n4 |a4|b4|c4|d4\n5 |a5|b5|c5|d5\n6 |a6|b6|c6|d6\n7 |a7|b7|c7|d7\n8 |a8|b8|c8|d8\n9 |a9|b9|c9|d9\n10|bA|LC|e0|e5\n11|dA|  |e1|e6\n12|Is|  |e2|e7\n13|Vh|  |e3|e8\n14|M+|  |e4|e9\n15|M-|  |  |  \n\nSignals are then selected\nwith a decoder (active low).\nS_adec(a,b)=M\nS|\\M\n0|0\n1|1\n2|2\n3|3\n"
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.748 131.826 0)
